  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KRF Inclusive political parties in Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contributing to responsive and inclusive political parties in Ethiopia.This program will also strengthen the capacity to participate in political processes specifically for women, youth and persons with disabilities. Outcome 1: Knowledge on the status of inclusion of marginalized groups in political parties in Ethiopia is improved, with focus on gender and youth. Outcome 2: Marginalized groups from political parties strengthen their capacity to effectively utilize their political positions. Outcome 3: Political parties have improved internal governance to increase the participation of marginalized groups.</narrative>
  </description>
